+
+/*! \def RAPIDJSON_VALIDATE_DEFAULT_FLAGS
+    \ingroup RAPIDJSON_CONFIG
+    \brief User-defined kValidateDefaultFlags definition.
+
+    User can define this as any \c ValidateFlag combinations.
