+Example of use:
+
+```cpp
+char* twochars = "\xe6\x97\xa5\xd1\x88";
+char* w = twochars;
+int cp = unchecked::next(w);
+assert (cp == 0x65e5);
+assert (w == twochars + 3);
+```
